<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Welcome to The Growth Project, Coach {{coach_name}}</h1>
    <p>Your coach account is ready. Here's what to do next:</p>
    <ol style="line-height: 1.6;">
      <li>Set up your coach profile and branding</li>
      <li>Invite your first 3 clients with your invite link below</li>
      <li>Build your first workout or meal template</li>
    </ol>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{console_url}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Open the coach console</a>
    </p>
    {{#if invite_link}}
      <p style="font-size: 14px;">Your default invite link: <a href="{{invite_link}}">{{invite_link}}</a></p>
    {{/if}}
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">Reply to this email if you need a hand getting set up.</p>
  </body>
</html>
